      "writtenOn": "2026-08-06T07:19:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Our understanding is that supporting TBT requires setting the `Is_Alt_Mode_Adapter` flag. Once `Is_Alt_Mode_Adapter` is enabled, the tool mandates the configuration of the AMA-related fields.",
