      "writtenOn": "2026-08-06T17:55:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe this was the case in the VIF spec until version 3.33, released in December 2024. If you\u0027re setting `Is_Alt_Mode_Adapter` because of the VIF spec, you don\u0027t have to anymore. That also means that you don\u0027t need to set the other AMA fields or have the DUT respond to Discovery with Modal Operation\u003d1/Intel SVID/TBT mode.\n\nAre you setting it to satisfy the VIF spec or because of some requirement of TBT cert outside of the VIF spec?",
